Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
HostKey /tmp/offsec-ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PidFile /tmp/sshd.pid

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
UsePAM no
UseDNS no

AllowTcpForwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
X11Forwarding no
PermitTunnel no
GatewayPorts no

PrintMotd no
PrintLastLog no
LogLevel VERBOSE
VersionAddendum OffSecLab-M01
